{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 583797, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 116886, "uid": 154257, "type": 4, "title": "RB、RACE通用魂卡总表", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1676379633, "updated_at": 1687019062, "updated_uid": 154257, "comment_at": 1688894306, "last_at": 1688894306, "comment_count": 19, "status": 1, "summary": "最后更新内容：增加了无氪/低氪玩家魂卡投资规划本表收录了5人巨大BOSS本中所有通用性较高的魂卡。刀卡的选择标准是属性带攻、词条未绑定NS或SS技能，这样无论是搭配NS刀或SS刀、平砍或FT，词条都会", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1307/h_1597/1164/154257/2023/5/17/186271.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 6, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 5779, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "吉林省", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 583797, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">最后更新内容：增加了无氪/低氪玩家魂卡投资规划</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">本表收录了5人巨大BOSS本中所有通用性较高的魂卡。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">刀卡的选择标准是属性带攻、词条未绑定NS或SS技能，这样无论是搭配NS刀或SS刀、平砍或FT，词条都会生效。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">另外还有一张凯布利无限制SS增伤，在RB全面更新为纯NS刀之前也能上场，而且兼容RACE和WB。</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">辅助卡只收录减益回避词条。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">所有数据为+0</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">普卡。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\">星云奖励：2-7艳后，3-8凯布利，4-8台球丽莎</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"><em></em><em></em></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">无氪/低氪玩家魂卡投资规划</span></div>\n                                    <div class=\"fold-color-wrapper\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">\n                                      <label>折叠颜色：</label>\n                                      <div class=\"fold-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">铁匠铺每月可用一张垃圾5星魂卡+300w金币换5张5星枕头，3星魂卡还可再换一张。</span><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div>对无氪/低氪玩家来说，抽完主力角色之后钻石已不充裕，应优先考虑抽5属性各4张血防+减益回避24%的辅助卡，同时配合洗饰品2号栏的减益回避词条，在高难本中可起到质变效果。</div><div><br></div><div>至于刀卡对本群体来说投资优先度并不高，因为即使是毕业卡和普池卡相比，也仅仅是多了10%+的词条而已，而且实际也未必有资源突破。</div><div><br></div><div>一个性价比较高的折中方案是干脆不抽刀卡，只用艳后养老，先准备出枕头，等拿到星云的闪艳后直接砸满。如果提前拿到一张普卡也可+4先用着，回头用闪卡吞掉+4的。</div><div><br></div><div>在拿到艳后之前，可以随便用普池里主属性血攻或攻暴的过渡，因为容易+5，虽然词条没用，但里外里效果并不比白板艳后差。</div><div><br></div><div>WB二号刀可用星云的凯布利，思路同艳后。</div></div>\n                               </div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1307\" data-height=\"1597\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1307/h_1597/1164/154257/2023/5/17/186271.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1307/h_1597/1164/154257/2023/5/17/186271.jpg\"></div><br></div><br></div><br></div><br></div><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1307/h_1597/1164/154257/2023/5/17/186271.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 227688, "content_num": 55, "read_num": 253212, "like_num": 426}, "update_user": {"uid": 154257, "username": "时崎狂肝", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/7.png", "description": "人生就像一场电影，总要有人演写攻略的。", "follow_num": 46, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video